{"id":"938378420d182ce3","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-positive-closure.md","title":"T 正公式的句法闭包","display":"prop-positive-closure — T 正公式的句法闭包","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-positive-closure","aliases":["91-prop-positive-closure"],"display":"prop-positive-closure — T 正公式的句法闭包","depends_on":["[[91-df-positive-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-positive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-positive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-positive-closure — T 正公式的句法闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是对象变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi,\\ \\forall x\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T,\n\\qquad\\theta,\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi,\\ \\forall x\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T,\n\\qquad\\theta,\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这些操作不增加负位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。一般否定不保持正性；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(x)\">\\(T(x)\\)</span> 正而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(x)\">\\(\\neg T(x)\\)</span> 非正。蕴涵和双条件应先展开再判断。\n正性不蕴含语义确定或固定点同值，但在标准 KF 中它足以给出原书 Lemma 15.4 的全部统一正去引号实例。不能从“可能有间隙”误推 KF 不证明正公式的 T-schema。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.3、Lemma 15.4，印刷页 187。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\\quad\n\\varphi\\land\\psi,\\ \\varphi\\lor\\psi,\\ \\forall x\\varphi,\\ \\exists x\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T,\n\\qquad\\theta,\\neg\\theta\\in\\mathrm{PosFml}_T.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1122,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb8ec521f1c6bc18","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-positive-closure]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-positive-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["e4ff0dbf2ccbb847"]}